= The Beijing Coup

Suddenly, the "Christian Warlord" Feng Yuxiang's 3rd Zhili Army has couped President Cao Kun and have taken control of the government!

This betrayal has shocked the Zhili Clique hard. Wu Peifu angrily withdrew from Shanhaiguan to retake Beijing, but it was no use. Zhang Zuolin defeated the Zhili and Wu Peifu was sent routing south.

Now, Feng Yuxiang has completely split from the Zhili Clique, forming his own faction, the *Guominjun*. The Christian Warlord has begun recieving aid and supplies from the Soviets, further counterbalancing Japanese influence in Manchuria.

