This has completely changed the world of Chinese politics. With this betrayal, Feng Yuxiang and Zhang Zuolin have now decisively defeated the Zhili Clique. These two are now the most powerful warlords in China.

Wu Peifu and Sun Chuanfang bitterly stay in their bastions of Wuchang and Nanjing respectively, as the two begin reorganizing the North in their vision.

To avoid further fighting, Feng and Zhang have decided to appoint Duan Qirui to lead a provisional government in Beijing, although he is effectively a puppet of both.
